'''Portal''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2020 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made up of a black frame with a silver outline that has triangular points by the edge. Inside the frame is a red portal with a swirly design over it, hence the name. The guard is silver, and the handle is black with two silver beams and a screw in the center.

==Trivia==
* It has a [[Portal (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name. However, its counterpart is an uncommon instead of a rare.

